    {
      "id": "craft-order",
      "order": 110,
      "title": "Craft order",
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "type": "overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        "The recommended order is: finish quality, sockets, and normal crafts; apply Vaal Orb to corrupt the item; then, only as a final gamble, use Architect's Orb.",
        "Using Architect's Orb before corruption is impossible, and using it before other crafts are done risks destroying work you cannot redo."
      ],
      "bullets": [
        "Normal crafts -> Vaal Orb (corrupt) -> Architect's Orb (final gamble).",
        "Never use Architect's Orb as an early step."
      ]
    },
